's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"acd8013f2fa07cbc4b09e9c1dea9a5c2","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"2518e90eaefdab7860aa861e047361b4","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"ca82cbe4adcab2bb77b2eeed8be11a3a","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"ee541568e9c96b8262b4ca6d9d6ad141","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"d93e07dcc53c818efe2bf8fd72a37f00","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"7c34eb7712caa5db93802bc64b496f29","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"70d52b09c321580252ec72649041fef5","originalFileName":"0654201a-d15f-4b53-9c02-2644cb5ba536-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"a2eb0341